# game/ch04.rpy:12
translate english ch4_dc4b2a7a:

    # n "周六上午，妈妈网购的快递到了，阿狐抢着帮忙拆箱。"
    n "Saturday morning. A package Mom ordered online arrived, and Ahu rushed to help unwrap it."

# game/ch04.rpy:13
translate english ch4_b4acd56f:

    # n "拆开纸箱，生活用品下面居然躺着一张烫金卡片：「电商周年庆·幸运用户刮刮卡」，还印着电商标志。"
    n "Under the daily goods in the box lay a gold-embossed card: \"E-commerce Anniversary Lucky Scratch Card\", printed with the shop's logo."

# game/ch04.rpy:14
translate english ch4_ba2c8c94:

    # mc laugh "妈妈快看，快递里还送了张刮刮卡！"
    mc laugh "Mom, look! The package came with a scratch card!"

# game/ch04.rpy:15
translate english ch4_223b09b2:

    # n "阿狐用力一刮——「恭喜您中得二等奖：平板电脑一台，价值2999元！」"
    n "Ahu scratched hard — \"Congratulations! You've won Second Prize: a tablet worth 2,999 yuan!\""

# game/ch04.rpy:16
translate english ch4_9bf1233d:

    # think laugh "哇，平板电脑！我们这是撞大运了吗？"
    think laugh "Wow, a tablet! Did we just hit the jackpot?"

# game/ch04.rpy:17
translate english ch4_38582260:

    # n "卡片背面写着：扫码添加客服，验证身份即可领取奖品。"
    n "On the back it said: scan the code to add customer service and verify your identity to claim the prize."

# game/ch04.rpy:21
translate english ch4_b0fe0129:

    # n "阿狐扫码加上了一个昵称叫「中奖客服」的人。"
    n "Ahu scanned the code and added someone nicknamed \"Prize Support\"."

# game/ch04.rpy:22
translate english ch4_a3fc2ee1:

    # fraud laugh "恭喜恭喜！您中了我们周年庆的二等奖，平板电脑一台！只要缴纳200元「好运运费」，奖品立刻包邮到家！"
    fraud laugh "Congratulations! You've won our anniversary Second Prize — a tablet! Just pay a 200-yuan \"lucky shipping fee\" and it will be delivered to your door!"

# game/ch04.rpy:23
translate english ch4_3f5409bd:

    # fraud serious "名额有限，今天不领，奖品就回收作废了哦！"
    fraud serious "Spots are limited — if you don't claim it today, the prize will be voided!"

# game/ch04.rpy:37
translate english ch4_A_b8e461e8:

    # n "阿狐盯着卡片上「先交钱」三个字，越想越不对：中奖是好事，为什么要我先掏钱？"
    n "Ahu stared at the words \"pay first\" on the card. Something felt wrong: winning is a good thing, so why should I pay first?"

# game/ch04.rpy:38
translate english ch4_A_3e8dfa81:

    # think serious "学校反诈课讲过，正规中奖不会让中奖人先交钱！"
    think serious "The anti-fraud class taught us: a legitimate prize never makes the winner pay first!"

# game/ch04.rpy:39
translate english ch4_A_0b502ff6:

    # mc serious "妈妈，快递里的刮刮卡说我中了平板，但要先交200元运费，是真的吗？"
    mc serious "Mom, the scratch card in the package says I won a tablet, but I have to pay 200 yuan shipping first. Is that real?"

# game/ch04.rpy:40
translate english ch4_A_ed0bdaf8:

    # mom serious "宝贝，这是骗子塞进快递里的「中奖卡」！这种卡人人刮开都「中奖」，为的就是骗你扫码交钱。天上不会掉馅饼，直接扔掉。"
    mom serious "Sweetie, this is a \"prize card\" planted by scammers! Everyone who scratches one \"wins\" — it's all a trick to make you scan and pay. There's no free lunch. Throw it away."

# game/ch04.rpy:41
translate english ch4_A_68ea2daf:

    # n "妈妈把刮刮卡扔进垃圾桶，还提醒了快递驿站和邻居们注意。"
    n "Mom threw the card into the trash and warned the pickup station and the neighbors."

# game/ch04.rpy:44
translate english ch4_A_118e4b65:

    # police laugh "做得好！「快递刮刮卡中奖」是骗子混进物流环节的老套路，卡片人人「中奖」，专门骗「运费」「保证金」。凡是领奖先交钱，一律是诈骗！"
    police laugh "Well done! \"Prize scratch cards in packages\" is an old trick: every card \"wins\", just to steal \"shipping fees\" and \"deposits\". Any prize that asks for money first is a scam!"

# game/ch04.rpy:56
translate english ch4_B_91f25c4c:

    # mc confused "不是说我中奖了吗？为什么领奖还要我先交钱呀？"
    mc confused "Didn't I win? Why do I have to pay first to claim my prize?"

# game/ch04.rpy:57
translate english ch4_B_22966259:

    # fraud laugh "这是快递保价费和人工派送费呀，官方补贴了大部分，您只需承担200元！您看，昨天有位阿姨刚领走平板，这是签收图！"
    fraud laugh "It's the insured shipping and handling fee! The company covers most of it, so you only pay 200 yuan. Look — a lady claimed her tablet just yesterday. Here's the delivery photo!"

# game/ch04.rpy:58
translate english ch4_B_4205b377:

    # n "对方发来一张「用户签收」照片，看起来有模有样。"
    n "The scammer sent a \"delivery confirmation\" photo that looked quite convincing."

# game/ch04.rpy:59
translate english ch4_B_f6716266:

    # fraud serious "您只需提供姓名、电话、收货地址，再扫码付200元运费，平板今晚就发货！"
    fraud serious "Just give me your name, phone number, and address, then scan and pay the 200-yuan shipping fee — the tablet ships tonight!"

# game/ch04.rpy:73
translate english ch4_B1_1ddaf061:

    # n "阿狐压住心里的期待，关掉对话，拿着手机走到客厅找妈妈。"
    n "Ahu pushed down his excitement, closed the chat, and took the phone to the living room to find Mom."

# game/ch04.rpy:74
translate english ch4_B1_e629b41c:

    # think worried "虽然很想要平板，但中奖还要先交钱，总觉得不太对劲。"
    think worried "I really want that tablet, but paying to claim a prize feels off."

# game/ch04.rpy:75
translate english ch4_B1_b3858b68:

    # mc worried "妈妈，刮刮卡说我中了平板，客服却让我先交200元运费，你看是真的吗？"
    mc worried "Mom, the scratch card says I won a tablet, but the support agent wants 200 yuan shipping first. Is it real?"

# game/ch04.rpy:76
translate english ch4_B1_5605c7a0:

    # mom serious "假的宝贝。你看这张卡，随便谁刮开都「中大奖」；签收图是骗子伪造的。领奖先交钱的，百分之百是诈骗。"
    mom serious "It's fake, sweetie. Look — anyone who scratches this card \"wins big\", and the delivery photo is forged. A prize that asks for money first is a scam, one hundred percent."

# game/ch04.rpy:77
translate english ch4_B1_84962cc9:

    # n "妈妈陪阿狐举报拉黑了对方，还把刮刮卡拍照发到业主群，提醒大家别上当。"
    n "Mom helped Ahu report and block the scammer, and posted a photo of the card in the owners' group chat to warn everyone."

# game/ch04.rpy:80
translate english ch4_B1_1a271e36:

    # police laugh "遇到可疑的中奖先停一停、问家长，你们做得非常棒！记住：正规奖品从不需要中奖人先付费！"
    police laugh "Pausing to ask your parents about a suspicious prize — excellent work! Remember: a legitimate prize never asks the winner to pay first!"

# game/ch04.rpy:92
translate english ch4_B2_63983c2b:

    # mc serious "那这样吧，货到付款，我收到平板验完货再付运费。"
    mc serious "How about this: cash on delivery. I'll pay the shipping fee after the tablet arrives and I check it."

# game/ch04.rpy:93
translate english ch4_B2_619bb6c9:

    # fraud serious "不行！公司规定必须先付运费才能出库，否则视为放弃奖品，卡片作废！"
    fraud serious "No! Company policy: shipping must be paid before the item leaves the warehouse, or you forfeit the prize and the card is void!"

# game/ch04.rpy:94
translate english ch4_B2_1372456e:

    # think serious "中奖的人反倒要抢着给对方付钱？越想越不对劲……"
    think serious "The winner has to rush to pay THEM? The more I think, the weirder it gets..."

# game/ch04.rpy:95
translate english ch4_B2_8555fc32:

    # n "阿狐没有再理会。半小时后，对方头像变灰——账号已注销。"
    n "Ahu ignored it. Half an hour later, the avatar went gray — the account was deleted."

# game/ch04.rpy:98
translate english ch4_B2_c0c58167:

    # police serious "你坚持「先验货、后付款」，让骗子无处下手！记住：一听到货到付款就翻脸、逼你「先交钱」的，都是骗子。"
    police serious "You insisted on \"inspect first, pay later\" and left the scammer no opening! Remember: anyone who flips out at cash-on-delivery and pushes you to \"pay first\" is a scammer."

# game/ch04.rpy:110
translate english ch4_B3_82c0153d:

    # n "阿狐按要求填写了姓名、电话和家庭住址，正准备扫码支付200元运费。"
    n "Ahu filled in his name, phone number, and home address as instructed, and was about to scan and pay the 200-yuan fee."

# game/ch04.rpy:111
translate english ch4_B3_213b7ad8:

    # n "就在付款页面弹出的一瞬间，他突然想起老师的反诈课堂：领奖先交钱的，都是诈骗！"
    n "The moment the payment page popped up, he remembered the anti-fraud lesson: any prize that asks for money first is a scam!"

# game/ch04.rpy:112
translate english ch4_B3_5759abca:

    # think serious "等等！我中大奖了，怎么还要我倒贴钱？不对劲！"
    think serious "Wait! I'm the winner — why would I pay THEM? Something's wrong!"

# game/ch04.rpy:113
translate english ch4_B3_5fe39404:

    # mc serious "我不付了，你是骗子！"
    mc serious "I'm not paying. You're a scammer!"

# game/ch04.rpy:114
translate english ch4_B3_2219f680:

    # n "阿狐立刻把事情告诉妈妈。妈妈拉黑了对方，并叮嘱：以后收件人只写妈妈的名字和电话，住址不能随便告诉陌生人。"
    n "Ahu told Mom right away. She blocked the scammer and reminded him: from now on, packages go under Mom's name and phone only, and never give your home address to strangers."

# game/ch04.rpy:117
translate english ch4_B3_1c6a647e:

    # police serious "虽然没付钱，但姓名、电话、住址已经泄露！骗子可能实施「快递理赔」「冒充客服」等二次诈骗，以后收到陌生电话短信一定要多个心眼。"
    police serious "You didn't pay, but your name, phone, and address are already leaked! Scammers may follow up with \"package compensation\" or \"fake support\" scams. Be extra careful with strange calls and texts."

# game/ch04.rpy:129
translate english ch4_C_a4109482:

    # n "阿狐生怕错过大奖，赶紧追问领奖流程。"
    n "Afraid of missing the big prize, Ahu hurried to ask how to claim it."

# game/ch04.rpy:130
translate english ch4_C_85782353:

    # think laugh "平板电脑我来了，可千万别过期！"
    think laugh "Here I come, tablet! Please don't expire!"

# game/ch04.rpy:131
translate english ch4_C_7a90ec2f:

    # mc laugh "你好！我要领奖，需要怎么操作？我马上就办！"
    mc laugh "Hello! I want to claim my prize. What do I do? I'm ready right now!"

# game/ch04.rpy:132
translate english ch4_C_3c7054c0:

    # fraud laugh "真爽快！请您扫码支付200元「好运运费」，付完立刻进入发货队列！"
    fraud laugh "Wonderful! Just scan and pay the 200-yuan \"lucky shipping fee\", and you'll be in the delivery queue right away!"

# game/ch04.rpy:146
translate english ch4_C1_d31534fa:

    # n "手指刚要点开付款页面，阿狐心里突然咯噔一下。"
    n "Just as his finger reached for the payment page, Ahu's heart suddenly skipped."

# game/ch04.rpy:147
translate english ch4_C1_c4629b1b:

    # think serious "不对！是我中奖，为什么反过来要我给对方付钱？领奖先交钱的就是骗子！"
    think serious "Wait! I won the prize — why would I pay THEM? A prize that asks for money first is a scam!"

# game/ch04.rpy:148
translate english ch4_C1_1f843680:

    # mc serious "奖品我不要了！往别人快递里塞假中奖卡骗人，我要举报你！"
    mc serious "Keep the prize! Stuffing fake prize cards into people's packages to cheat them — I'm reporting you!"

# game/ch04.rpy:149
translate english ch4_C1_aa196629:

    # n "阿狐果断退出对话、举报账号，把整件事告诉了妈妈。妈妈夸了他，还提醒驿站和邻居注意。"
    n "Ahu left the chat, reported the account, and told Mom everything. She praised him and warned the pickup station and the neighbors."

# game/ch04.rpy:152
translate english ch4_C1_cf6c11ae:

    # police serious "面对「到手的奖品」还能保持清醒，非常了不起！记住：所有中奖诈骗都是拿「大奖」当诱饵，骗你先交「小钱」。"
    police serious "Staying clear-headed in front of a \"prize in hand\" — remarkable! Remember: every prize scam dangles a \"big reward\" to steal your \"small fee\" first."

# game/ch04.rpy:164
translate english ch4_C2_6174d5a1:

    # n "阿狐既怕奖品作废，又有点不放心，决定先付200元运费试试。"
    n "Afraid the prize would expire yet still uneasy, Ahu decided to pay the 200-yuan shipping fee first."

# game/ch04.rpy:165
translate english ch4_C2_b0f2aaa0:

    # think laugh "先付运费，平板发货了再说，应该没事吧。"
    think laugh "Pay the shipping first, deal with the rest when it ships. Should be fine... right?"

# game/ch04.rpy:166
translate english ch4_C2_18906db5:

    # n "200元转了过去。紧接着对方又发来消息。"
    n "The 200 yuan went through. Another message came right away."

# game/ch04.rpy:167
translate english ch4_C2_5af07180:

    # fraud serious "系统提示：您的奖品还需缴纳200元「公证费」才能出库，请继续支付！"
    fraud serious "System notice: your prize needs another 200-yuan \"notary fee\" before it can leave the warehouse. Please keep paying!"

# game/ch04.rpy:168
translate english ch4_C2_33c53e89:

    # mc confused "怎么又冒出一个公证费？到底还有多少项收费？"
    mc confused "Where did this notary fee come from? How many fees are there?"

# game/ch04.rpy:169
translate english ch4_C2_79822b4b:

    # n "阿狐越想越不对，把事情告诉妈妈。妈妈说这是典型的连环收费骗局，那200元已经追不回来了。"
    n "The more Ahu thought, the wronger it felt, and he told Mom. She said it was a classic chain-fee scam — the 200 yuan was unrecoverable."

# game/ch04.rpy:172
translate english ch4_C2_201cc224:

    # police serious "骗子的收费名目永远「还差最后一项」！只要付了第一笔，就会被一步步套牢。中奖缴费，一分都不能出！"
    police serious "A scammer's fees always have \"one last item\"! Pay the first one, and they'll reel you in step by step. Never pay a single cent to claim a prize!"

# game/ch04.rpy:184
translate english ch4_C3_929383d5:

    # n "阿狐深信不疑，先付200元运费，又付200元「公证费」，一共400元，满心期待等平板到家。"
    n "Fully convinced, Ahu paid 200 yuan shipping plus a 200-yuan \"notary fee\" — 400 yuan in total — and waited happily for his tablet."

# game/ch04.rpy:185
translate english ch4_C3_2fa842cc:

    # n "第二天，阿狐催问发货，对方让他再付500元「关税押金」，说是付完连奖品带押金一起退。"
    n "The next day, Ahu pushed about shipping. The scammer demanded another 500-yuan \"customs deposit\", promising to refund it together with the prize."

# game/ch04.rpy:186
translate english ch4_C3_7e3975fc:

    # mc confused "怎么一直要交钱？说好的平板呢？"
    mc confused "Why does it keep asking for money? Where's the tablet I won?"

# game/ch04.rpy:187
translate english ch4_C3_c8564bb2:

    # n "阿狐再发消息，页面弹出红色感叹号——已被拉黑，「客服」账号也已注销。"
    n "When Ahu messaged again, a red exclamation mark popped up — he'd been blocked, and the \"support\" account was deleted."

# game/ch04.rpy:188
translate english ch4_C3_1a3a1041:

    # think sad "说好的平板电脑呢……我把妈妈给的零花钱全搭进去了……"
    think sad "Where's the tablet...? All my allowance is gone..."

# game/ch04.rpy:189
translate english ch4_C3_e8ea977b:

    # n "阿狐哭着向妈妈承认了错误，妈妈抱了抱他。"
    n "Ahu admitted his mistake through tears, and Mom hugged him."

# game/ch04.rpy:190
translate english ch4_C3_92c1ab58:

    # mom normal "没关系，这次教训要记牢。刮刮卡、中奖短信都是骗局的诱饵，以后涉及钱的事，一定先问爸爸妈妈。"
    mom normal "It's okay, but remember this lesson. Scratch cards and prize texts are all bait. From now on, anything involving money goes through Mom and Dad first."

# game/ch04.rpy:193
translate english ch4_C3_fa9cb201:

    # police serious "小朋友记住！「快递刮刮卡中奖」专骗中小学生：先用假大奖让你心动，再用运费、公证费、关税层层收钱。领奖先交钱，就是诈骗！"
    police serious "Kids, remember! Package scratch cards target students: a fake big prize hooks you, then shipping fees, notary fees, and customs fees drain you. A prize that asks for money first is a scam!"

